WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.500
Step two.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.345
Fit the green winder into the slot on the left.

3
00:00:04.345 --> 00:00:05.610
Give it a turn.

4
00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.525
It turns, and it only comes out backwards.

5
00:00:08.525 --> 00:00:11.420
This winder will turn the film's own spool:

6
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.550
its forked end fits over a bar inside the film.

7
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:18.520
So the green winder winds each picture back into the film's shell,

8
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.115
and the red winder is where the film starts.

